      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Armstrong%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Armstrong began in 1892 when the Chicago & Iowa Western Railroad crossed the area, turning a quiet settlement into a rail town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/armstrong_iowa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Thomsen Round Barn in Armstrong earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places for its unique circular design.",
